== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[sjö]]'' "[[seven]]". Meaning '''twenty and seven'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''tuttugu og sjö''' {{indecl}}

# [[twenty-seven]], cardinal number after [[tuttugu og sex]] and before [[tuttugu og átta]]

